                <pb facs="0261" n="205" xml:id="pg205"/>

                <head>No. 101.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">General Schenck to Mr. Fish</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1876-02-15"><hi rendition="#italic">February</hi> 15,
                        1876</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Winslow arrested. Send charge with proof at once.</p>
                <closer><signed>SCHENCK.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
